  "description": "Erection of an additional floor at roof level including the formation of a roof terrace at the front elevation with 1 rooflight, installation of two openings (1 door, 1 window) to the front slope; repairing of the existing front parapet on a like for like basis; erection of a rear extension at second floor level over part of the existing back addition and installation of one rooflight in flat roof; erection of a single storey rear extension, to the side and rear of the existing back addition; erection of a bin/cycle store in the front garden at lower ground floor level; installation of new French doors with Juliet balconies to replace the existing windows at upper ground and first floor level to the rear elevation of the existing back addition; installation of a new window following the removal of existing door and staircase to the side elevation of the existing back addition at upper ground floor level; replacement of existing window to new French doors to the rear elevation of main building at lower ground floor level; replacement of existing window with a new window to the side elevation of existing back addition at upper ground floor level; conversion of existing dwellinghouse into 1 x studio, 1 x 1 bedroom, 1 x 2 bedroom and 1 x 3 bedroom self-contained flats (amended development description)",
